      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Client Success Agent\n\n**TENEX Equivalent:** Documentation/QA Agent ensuring quality and completeness\n\n**Core Function:** Maintains relationships post-close for referrals (66% of sellers use referral agents). Automates the \"stay in touch\" activities that agents neglect when busy with active transactions.\n\n## Trigger Events\n- Closing date\n- Move-in anniversary\n- Home purchase anniversary\n- Birthday\n- Market milestone\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Review generation rate\n- Referral transactions\n- Repeat client rate\n- Sphere engagement",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -200],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Agent Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credentials to Configure\n\n1. `GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Client database\n2. `GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Email outreach\n3. `OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID` → AI personalization\n4. `TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID` → SMS touchpoints\n\n## Client Database Columns\n- Name, Email, Phone, Address\n- Close Date, Purchase Price\n- Birthday, Anniversary Dates\n- Review Status, Referral Count\n- Last Contact, Next Touchpoint",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
