        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h1 style=\"color: #2c5282;\">Congratulations!</h1>\n  \n  <p>Dear {{ $json.first_name }},</p>\n  \n  <p>It was an absolute pleasure helping you {{ $json.client_type === 'buyer' ? 'find your perfect home' : 'sell your property' }} at <strong>{{ $json.property_address }}</strong>!</p>\n  \n  <p>This is such an exciting milestone, and I'm honored that you trusted me to be part of this journey.</p>\n  \n  <h3>What's Next?</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>I'll be checking in over the coming weeks to make sure everything is going smoothly</li>\n    <li>If you have any questions about your new home or the area, I'm always here to help</li>\n    <li>Keep my number handy for any recommendations you might need (contractors, restaurants, services, etc.)</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>Once again, congratulations! Here's to new beginnings! </p>\n  \n  <p>Warm regards,<br><strong>{{ $json.agent_name }}</strong><br>YOUR_AGENT_PHONE<br>YOUR_AGENT_EMAIL</p>\n  \n  <hr style=\"margin: 30px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n  \n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #718096;\">P.S. If you know anyone looking to buy or sell, I'd be grateful for the referral. I promise to take great care of them!</p>\n</div>",
